    "title": "KSAT Medal giveaway with Ernie Zuniga - NewsBreak",
    "text": "6 days ago Get ready, San Antonio—KSAT and Floor & Decor are celebrating Fiesta in style with a special KSAT Fiesta Medal giveaway at Floor & Decor on Monday, March 23rd. We’ll be set up outside at Floor & Decor, at 7607 I-35 South, Ste.#105, San Antonio, TX 78224, so look for the Floor & Decor storefront and follow the crowd of Fiesta fanatics, cascarones, and medal collectors heading that way! Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
